ello World","Welcome to my new blog!",["Date","2026-04-25T00:00:00.000Z"],"# Welcome to my new blog\n\nThis blog is built using **Astro** and the **Spearhead** theme aesthetics.\n\n## Why Astro?\nAstro is a modern web framework that prioritizes content and performance. It allows me to write posts in Markdown while maintaining a high-quality design.\n\n### Markdown Support\nYou can use standard Markdown features like:\n- Lists\n- **Bold text**\n- *Italic text*\n- [Links](https://astro.build)\n\nEnjoy!\n\n### Embed Tests\nYouTube:\n@@https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ@@\n\nSpotify:\n@@https://open.spotify.com/track/1QJbDTZAO8rpGOMG4UahFM?si=4d015eb77e5f4d74@@\n\nCustom Iframe:\n@@\u003Ciframe data-testid=\"embed-iframe\" style=\"border-radius:12px\" src=\"https://open.spotify.com/embed/track/1QJbDTZAO8rpGOMG4UahFM?utm_source=generator\" width=\"100%\" height=\"352\" frameBorder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; fullscreen; picture-in-picture\" loading=\"lazy\">\u003C/iframe>@@","src/content/posts/hello-world.md","99ba5ec90b63ed47",{"html":21,"metadata":22},"\u003Ch1 id=\"welcome-to-my-new-blog\">Welcome to my new blog\u003C/h1>\n\u003Cp>This blog is built using \u003Cstrong>Astro\u003C/strong> and the \u003Cstrong>Spearhead\u003C/strong> theme aesthetics.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"why-astro\">Why Astro?\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>Astro is a modern web framework that prioritizes content and performance. It allows me to write posts in Markdown while maintaining a high-quality design.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"markdown-support\">Markdown Support\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>You can use standard Markdown features like:\u003C/p>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>Lists\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Bold text\u003C/strong>\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cem>Italic text\u003C/em>\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Ca href=\"https://astro.build\">Links\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Cp>Enjoy!\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"embed-tests\">Embed Tests\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>YouTube:\n\u003C/p>\u003Cdiv class=\"embed-container\">\u003Ciframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/dQw4w9WgXcQ\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen>\u003C/iframe>\u003C/div>\u003Cp>\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>Spotify:\n\u003C/p>\u003Cdiv class=\"embed-container\">\u003Ciframe style=\"border-radius:12px\" src=\"https://open.spotify.com/embed/track/1QJbDTZAO8rpGOMG4UahFM?si=4d015eb77e5f4d74\" width=\"100%\" height=\"152\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen allow=\"autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; fullscreen; picture-in-picture\" loading=\"lazy\">\u003C/iframe>\u003C/div>\u003Cp>\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>Custom Iframe:\n\u003C/p>\u003Cdiv class=\"embed-container\">\u003Ciframe data-testid=\"embed-iframe\" style=\"border-radius:12px\" src=\"https://open.spotify.com/embed/track/1QJbDTZAO8rpGOMG4UahFM?utm_source=generator\" width=\"100%\" height=\"352\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen allow=\"autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; fullscreen; picture-in-picture\" loading=\"lazy\">\u003C/iframe>\u003C/div>\u003Cp>\u003C/p>",{"headings":23,"localImagePaths":39,"remoteImagePaths":40,"frontmatter":41,"imagePaths":43},[24,28,32,36],{"depth":25,"slug":26,"text":27},1,"welcome-to-my-new-blog","Welcome to my new blog",{"depth":29,"slug":30,"text":31},2,"why-astro","Why Astro?",{"depth":33,"slug":34,"text":35},3,"markdown-support","Markdown Support",{"depth":33,"slug":37,"text":38},"embed-tests","Embed Tests",[],[],{"title":14,"description":15,"date":42},"2026-04-25",[]]